<AppPage
  app="Pop Drop"
  slug="pop-drop"
  icon="/assets/apps/pop-drop-icon-256.png"
  accent="#ffe000"
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="Pop Drop doesn't collect, store or share any personal data."
>
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated 21 November 2026</p>

  <p class="lede">Pop Drop doesn't collect, store or share any personal data. There are no accounts, ads, analytics or tracking.</p>

  <h2>What stays on your iPhone</h2>
  <p>Your settings, best score, biggest ball and unfinished round are saved on your iPhone only. They never leave it, and they're deleted when you delete the app.</p>

  <h2>Game Center</h2>
  <p>If you're signed in to Game Center, your best score is sent to Apple so it can appear on the leaderboard. Apple handles that under its own <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/">privacy policy</a>. You can sign out of Game Center in your iPhone's Settings at any time, and the game plays the same without it.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Pop Drop collects no data from anyone, children included.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this ever changes, this page will say so first, with a new date at the top.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:baralrobin@gmail.com">baralrobin@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</AppPage>
